rganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9d4ecf2b565ff9ed.webp\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"medium\":{\"height\":223,\"width\":300,\"url\":\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9d4ecf2b565ff9ed.webp\",\"orientation\":\"landscape\"},\"full\":{\"url\":\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9d4ecf2b565ff9ed.webp\",\"height\":336,\"width\":452,\"orientation\":\"landscape\"}},\"caption\":\"\",\"id\":0,\"alt\":\"\"},\"iWidth\":{\"md\":\"100\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"imWidth\":{\"md\":\"100\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"iHeig\":{\"md\":\"336\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"xs\":\"300\",\"sm\":\"300\"},\"imgFit\":{\"md\":\"cover\"},\"ibrad\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"xs\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalBorderRadius\":{\"md\":8,\"sm\":8,\"xs\":8},\"globalBorderRadiusFallback\":{\"md\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"sm\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"xs\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\"}},\"globalBRadius\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"xs\":{\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"20\",\"bottom\":\"20\",\"left\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"globalBorderRadius\":{\"md\":8,\"sm\":8,\"xs\":8},\"globalBorderRadiusFallback\":{\"md\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"sm\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\",\"xs\":\"20px 20px 20px 20px\"}},\"globalBShadow\":{\"openShadow\":true,\"inset\":0,\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":4,\"blur\":8,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.40)\",\"globalShadow\":\"5\"},\"globalBShadowHover\":{\"openShadow\":true,\"inset\":0,\"horizontal\":0,\"vertical\":4,\"blur\":8,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0,0,0,0.40)\",\"globalShadow\":\"6\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-tpgb-tp-image tpgb-image tpgb-block-b224_29\"><figure class=\"tpgb-figure\"><img src=\"https://inventorganization.s3-tastewp.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9d4ecf2b565ff9ed.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"tpgb-img-inner wp-image-46791\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div>\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-image -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"3977_29\",\"title\":\"Whether you're a psychology enthusiast, a student of the mind, or simply curious about human behaviour\",\"titleTag\":\"p\",\"exproCnt\":\"In addition to adaptive interfaces, voice-activated navigation is becoming a staple in modern design. This trend not only caters to accessibility needs but also allows for hands-free interaction, which is increasingly important in our multitasking world. As voice recognition technology improves, we can expect to see it integrated more seamlessly into everyday applications.\",\"content\":\"In addition to adaptive interfaces, voice-activated navigation is becoming a staple in modern design. This trend not only caters to accessibility needs but also allows for hands-free interaction, which is increasingly important in our multitasking world. As voice recognition technology improves, we can expect to see it integrated more seamlessly into everyday applications.\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"titleTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"titleBtmSpace\":{\"md\":\"20\",\"unit\":\"px\"}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-3977_6afe815654b0c585f405f022\"><p class=\"pro-paragraph-inner\">In addition to adaptive interfaces, voice-activated navigation is becoming a staple in modern design. This trend not only caters to accessibility needs but also allows for hands-free interaction, which is increasingly important in our multitasking world. As voice recognition technology improves, we can expect to see it integrated more seamlessly into everyday applications.</p></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-container -->\n<!-- wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph {\"block_id\":\"6988_29\",\"Showtitle\":false,\"title\":\"\",\"exproCnt\":\"Finally, immersive virtual reality experiences are set to take center stage as hardware becomes more accessible and affordable. By creating environments that allow users to engage with content in a multi-sensory way, brands can foster deeper connections with their audiences. As we approach 2026, these trends will not only shape the future of design but also redefine how we perceive and interact with technology.\",\"content\":\"Finally, immersive virtual reality experiences are set to take center stage as hardware becomes more accessible and affordable. By creating environments that allow users to engage with content in a multi-sensory way, brands can foster deeper connections with their audiences. As we approach 2026, these trends will not only shape the future of design but also redefine how we perceive and interact with technology.\",\"alignment\":{\"md\":\"left\"},\"textTypo\":{\"openTypography\":0,\"size\":{\"md\":\"\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"height\":\"\",\"spacing\":\"\",\"fontFamily\":[]},\"globalMargin\":{\"md\":{\"top\":\"12\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"},\"unit\":\"px\",\"sm\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"unit\":\"px\"}}} --><div class=\"tpgb-pro-paragraph tpgb-block-6988_6afe815654b0c585f405f022\"><p class=\"pro-paragraph-inner\">Finally, immersive virtual reality experiences are set to take center stage as hardware becomes more accessible and affordable. By creating environments that allow users to engage with content in a multi-sensory way, brands can foster deeper connections with their audiences. As we approach 2026, these trends will not only shape the future of design but also redefine how we perceive and interact with technology.</p></div><!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-pro-paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:tpgb/tp-container -->\n"
}
